sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-trushko-epithelioid-cyst-buckling> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-trushko-epithelioid-cyst-buckling-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-trushko-epithelioid-cyst-buckling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Trushko et al. (2020) Dev. Cell & Hannezo et al. (2014) PNAS Föppl-von Kármán spherical epithelial cyst buckling under alginate confinement — MorphoEval overall 53.2/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2019-trushko-epithelioid-cyst-buckling.py` (overall weighted score: 56.2/100). The v1 script computes the analytical Zoelly spherical shell critical buckling pressure P_c = (2*E_epi/sqrt(3*(1-nu^2)))*(h/R_0)^2 across 3 buckled capsule regimes (standard 1-fold MDCK cyst, large thin-walled 2-fold cyst, and Blebbistatin myosin-II inhibited cyst), but uses a heuristic Gaussian dent profile instead of a nonlinear Föppl-von Kármán / vertex-elastic ring energy minimizer under elastic alginate capsule confinement, omits the unconfined/soft-alginate negative control and the 12-point (h/R_0) scaling sweep, and does not segment the vendored epithelial cyst histology micrograph (`epithelioid_cyst_specimen.jpg`). Overall 53.2/100 (faithfulness 47.1, reproducibility 67.6); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 33e07ad; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 58, Morphological realism / specimen match 35, Parameter expressivity 48, Morphometric validation 52, Source and data traceability 74, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/epithelioid_cyst_buckling_comparison.png: rendered output of 2019-trushko-epithelioid-cyst-buckling.py at 33e07ad, image/png, 124527 B, 1007×964 px, artifact_sha256 c509d37e8fa16b941cdd73e3bf5ccd77833c7933d9967e841467e55861360cff (sha256 c509d37e8fa16b941cdd73e3bf5ccd77833c7933d9967e841467e55861360cff), spec_fingerprint 8c51faae6711c461b674cf68b978bc7ce168e67b48347c008c6f0f5cae0506b9. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 8c51faae6711c461b674cf68b978bc7ce168e67b48347c008c6f0f5cae0506b9; artifact_sha256: c509d37e8fa16b941cdd73e3bf5ccd77833c7933d9967e841467e55861360cff; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/epithelioid_cyst_buckling/epithelioid_cyst_buckling_reference.json=c1412a6f1bcc24be..., datasets/epithelioid_cyst_buckling/epithelioid_cyst_specimen.jpg=ec5b534f7a3a8182..., datasets/epithelioid_cyst_buckling/paper_citations.bib=b14ab196e08a46d4..., datasets/epithelioid_cyst_buckling/scout_manifest.json=3d03ec2877bdf349...}." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Evaluate all 4 experimental regimes including the unconfined / soft-alginate negative control (P < P_c => spherical unbuckled monolayer, delta/R_0 = 0) and Blebbistatin myosin-II inhibition perturbation, plus the 12-point (h/R_0) critical buckling pressure sweep and post-confluence growth trajectory delta(t)/R_0 and t_b(tau_d).",
            "remediation needed: Replace the heuristic Gaussian contour with a nonlinear Föppl-von Kármán + vertex monolayer ring energy minimizer (`L-BFGS-B`) growing inside a spherical elastic alginate capsule (E_alg in [0.4, 10] kPa, R_0 in [58, 150] um) that resolves single-fold (n=1) vs two-fold (n=2) invagination mode selection.",
            "remediation needed: Segment the vendored epithelial cyst histology micrograph (`epithelioid_cyst_specimen.jpg`) via OpenCV/SciPy to extract cyst/lumen contour circularity, epithelial thickness ratio h/R_0, and boundary invagination fold depth, and enforce runtime SHA-256 verification of all dataset files." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.532"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 069 Pass 1 Assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

